  <description>
    <p>Red-pen the set without the red pen. MarkupCraft is part of the CadCraft family: eight free, open-source apps (Apache-2.0) for drafting, modeling, review and takeoff.</p>
    <p>What you can do in MarkupCraft preview:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Open a plan set and move between sheets</li>
      <li>Set your author name</li>
      <li>Mark up a sheet</li>
      <li>Select, move and change markups</li>
      <li>Stamps and sticky notes</li>
      <li>Calibrate a sheet and measure</li>
      <li>Statuses and replies</li>
      <li>Make a punch list</li>
      <li>The markups list, filters and exports</li>
      <li>Markup layers</li>
      <li>Spaces</li>
      <li>The tool chest</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Your files stay on your computer: nothing is uploaded, and the app never contacts getcadcraft.com. Every feature is free, for any work, commercial work included. No account, no sign-in, no ads. Works offline.</p>
    <p>This is an early release (preview). Help is built in, and the help says plainly what is not built yet.</p>
  </description>
